## Notes: An Aion-styled HUD for Azeroth Survivors: run chronometer with a boss timeline and boss countdowns, boss bars with debuffs, hero and target frames, quickbar, experience strip, tally, lairs, combat meter, winged banners, enemy health plates, floating combat numbers, and the rest of the UI too: inventory, character and inspect windows, chat, minimap, party frames with the game's unit menus and pointers to downed allies, tooltips and menus, and run records with personal bests. /aether
